                  working version and then improving it through testing and
                  iteration. This approach has led me to build products across
                  housing, job-search automation, web development and
                  cybersecurity experimentation.
                </p>

                <p>
                  I am especially interested in technology that can have a
                  practical impact in Kenya and other markets where a good
                  solution does not need to be complicated—it needs to be
                  useful, reliable and accessible.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div className="about-aside">
                <div className="profile-panel">
                  <div className="profile-initials">DK</div>
                  <div>
                    <span>Based in</span>
                    <strong>Kenya</strong>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <span>Focus</span>
                    <strong>Security + Software</strong>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <span>Work style</span>
                    <strong>Build · Test · Improve</strong>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
