            <div className="principles">
              <div>
                <span>01</span>
                <h3>Practical</h3>
                <p>Build around real user problems rather than technology for its own sake.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>02</span>
                <h3>Security-minded</h3>
                <p>Think about data, access, trust and failure cases throughout development.</p>
